# home-from-scope -- return-nav from the ScopeView BACK to home.
# [stol:ui-planner-cov-starts] Start context(scope) (reached by nav_home_to_scope)
# forces A* to route back via nav_scope_to_home, which no boot-start goal reaches.
# The SETUP route home->scope is driven first at --run but is NOT measured.
# start: context(scope)
context(home)
